<title>CANADA: Algonquin Mercantile Corp Q2 profit halves.</title>
<headline>Algonquin Mercantile Corp Q2 profit halves.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 ends July 28</p>
<p>			     1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.08		   C$0.16</p>
<p> Net			    500		    1,100</p>
<p> Revs			22,300		   27,200</p>
<p>	   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.46		   C$0.36</p>
<p> Net			  9,800		    2,100</p>
<p> Revs			41,000		   50,800</p>
<p>	  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The 1996 6-month results include a C$7.8 million</p>
<p>gain on the sale of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
